261.     ///
262.     /// Allocates a range of bits in the bitmap.
263.     ///
264.     /// # Parameters
265.     ///
266.     /// - `size`: Size of the range to allocate.
267.     ///
268.     /// # Returns
269.     ///
270.     /// Upon success, the index of the allocated range is returned. Upon failure, an error is returned
271.     /// instead.
272.     ///
